{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/51044-pact-issues","id":51044,"title":"Pact Issues","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-16T14:07:41-08:00","id":51044,"title":"Pact Issues","content":"There are a few issues in the pact section. For one, the writing is very redundant. The materials a pact can be written on, the fact that they are composed of aspects, and the fact that they get +1 Durability are all repeated twice. The first paragraph talks about combining aspects but there is no description as to why this is done. The sidebar mentions granting health in the form of a bonus to Stamina, but there are no rules for that in the benefits section. In the example with Perry, his Asset (Resources 3) should either have a cost of +2 or be Asset (Resources +3).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Eric Christian Berg</b><br /> <i>Onyx Path Freelancer</i><br /> Promethean: The Created Second Edition, Dark Eras Companion","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","name":"eberg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2019_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"284"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T16:48:31-08:00","id":51181,"title":"","content":"The Duration section has left me a little confused as well. It talks about how if a demon can get away with it, they'll set up pacts that are permanent on the demon's side, but not on the mortal's. Does that mean that Duration needs to be built in on both sides of the pact (because that's definitely not done in the examples) or is that something I'm misreading, talking about some benefit of a pact that a mortal can enter into that's impermanent by its nature (having a hard time coming up with examples)? <br /> <br /> I second the mention about Stamina. Were attributes left out, or is that mention of &quot;health (Stamina)&quot; a leftover from a previous draft or something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/689-smarmy-vamp","name":"Smarmy Vamp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar689_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T17:55:03-08:00","id":51238,"title":"","content":"Come to think of it, I would like to know too.<br /> <br /> As an aside: Granting Size would enable more health too.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T19:37:31-08:00","id":51308,"title":"","content":"I have a few bits of confusion as well,,, When the Demon's side of the pact benefits him more than the human's side, he must pay the difference in willpower. That makes sense. On the other hand, there is no payment for the human if his side is better. What (mechanically) stops a demon from just loading up the human side to equal his own side. The Demon personally doesn't have to give merits/skills/etc so it kind of seems like no skin off their backs outside of the WP to create the pact. I apologize if I overlooked the reason, but I went through it a couple of times and couldn't find an answer<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> As for duration, Demon X wants the cover permanently (+3 on his side) and gives a resource permanently to the human- is that an additional +3 for duration, and if so- to which side of the pact?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1895-chriszeke3","name":"ChrisZeke3","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-17T07:11:33-08:00","id":51598,"title":"","content":"Demon's are drug dealers, they always get the better deal; they always gain more than the mortal. If a Demon granted a mortal enough to give them everything then the Mortal didn't just get a taste their first time. They got a the whole bag. There's no reason to come back for more. The Demon pays out in willpower, but it's a slow investment to get to the point where the human is ready to offer their soul. If I were to come up to any of you and say, &quot;Hey, you give me your soul and I'll give you some cash&quot; You may either not believe me, or just flat out refuse. But if show you just a hint of what I can do for something as 'benign' as a memory. I can make you desperate for more. I can take your life piece by piece until finally you're ready for the big trade. Because you're hooked. I don't want a life of someone already on the edge, unless it's a cover I'm going to burn in the next few days. I want something lasting, something cultivated, a life that I've viewed and can take over. So sure, I could make it fair, and I could pay less willpower. But it's just Willpower, it's a small sacrifice on my end for having a Cover that I'm less likely to unravel by acting out of character for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-17T20:06:24-08:00","id":52100,"title":"","content":"The fluff text repeatedly mentions Demons acting as pushers, trying to get valuable pieces of a person's soul in return for a small boon of money, fame, health, whatever. There is, however, nothing stopping a demon from granting mortals their fondest desires while at the same time taking parts of that person's life they would rather be without in the first place. An altruistic demon, possibly trying to make up for his &quot;sins&quot; as an angel might actively seek out people who are suffering and take away those painful, destructive relationships and give them beauty, health, and friends. That would actually make a fantastic character concept.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1591-freshman","name":"Freshman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1591_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-18T13:05:04-08:00","id":52694,"title":"","content":"Let me just say that if we could get like -5 pages- of sample pacts, covering all sorts of edge cases and odd agreements...<br /> <br /> ... <b>this would perhaps be the most useful tool in the world for my group right now.</b><br /> <br /> I cannot stress enough how absolutely revelatory such a document could be.<br /> <br /> Please, God Machine, hear my prayer signal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-18T17:16:59-08:00","id":52869,"title":"","content":"I swore, I thought I read something that pacts get more coverage in the players guide.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-18T19:08:21-08:00","id":52930,"title":"","content":"Mechanically, I don't think there IS anything to stop a Demon from loading the human's side of the deal to equalize things and reduce his willpower cost. The demon trying to cheat the human is a Thematic/Fluff-driven part of the game.<br /> <br /> If however you wanted to ADD a mechanical reason, or even just imply one, simply put forward that to much change in a human's life/destiny via reality rewrites leaves telltale signs, and can attract the attention of the God-Machine. You want Bob's Law Degree and Practice, so you give Bob Money, Health, and Fame... Bob suddenly turned from a moderately successful lawyer into an unemployed, uneducated Millionaire Playboy Actor! Yep, that's not gonna attract a dozen hunter angels to see why reality tasted purple for half an hour. Not at all. (insert ugly GM laughter here).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-18T21:05:51-08:00","id":52980,"title":"","content":"Honestly, if I were one of the many demons who fell specifically because they found they actually gave a crap about people...I'd be very tempted to frontload pacts in favor of the mortal just to remove the <i>temptation</i> to hold them over a barrel for their souls later. Like &quot;someday, I'm going to get desperate and just eating this guy's entire life will start to look like a good idea. Let me make sure I won't actually be able to do that&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/996-gabby","name":"Gabby","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-18T23:05:26-08:00","id":53034,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gabby</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/51044-pact-issues?p=52980#post52980\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, if I were one of the many demons who fell specifically because they found they actually gave a crap about people...I'd be very tempted to frontload pacts in favor of the mortal just to remove the <i>temptation</i> to hold them over a barrel for their souls later. Like &quot;someday, I'm going to get desperate and just eating this guy's entire life will start to look like a good idea. Let me make sure I won't actually be able to do that&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Finally, Holloway\u2019s nerve broke. \u201cWhy? Why now? Haven\u2019t I done what you asked? I took the money you gave me \u2014 \u201c<br /> <br /> \u201cAnd made something of yourself. I know. I\u2019ve been watching. You\u2019ve had all the success I promised you. Your firm is involved in a dozen government building projects. That, I\u2019m afraid, is why our agreement has come due.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cBecause I had a good life?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u200b\u201cNo. Because I need it.\u201d The demon reached out lightning-quick and laid his palm flat on Holloway\u2019s chest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}